{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "470"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏海藏禪院寓居比丘單況\n等謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓興\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹貞治三年甲辰正月　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起欽明至皇極合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起孝德至元明合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起元正至廢帝合四君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起高野至承和合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起仁壽至承平合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起天曆至承保合十一君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起寬治盡建曆合十二君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師鍊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今之中堂所謂延曆寺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今改慶元府。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】辨下文或作辯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰相州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】此一句中文字恐可有錯落"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】二天當作三天眾三字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嶽竹和語相近"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國俗呼鳩為八幡使島"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弘法之徒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今改淨妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起拈主丈云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卓一下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擲拂\n子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶經大相國第三子。圓明寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徑山土地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本朝貴婦人賜佳后號。蓋位比皇后之佳稱也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本朝嘉祿二歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋俗迎兒產暮日行試業。猶如本朝三歲試問。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】慧當作惠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈主丈云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卓一下云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擲下云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈主丈云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靠丈云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈丈云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卓一下云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "驀拈主丈一畫云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拍牀云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竪拂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擊禪床下\n座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈主丈曰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靠丈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今曰多武峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後勑改勝尾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗號矢田寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良相女"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "染殿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山麓云尾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "松尾明神。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上東門院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圖俗量箭以手握為準。蓋一握者四指也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】憬一作璟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太子手印記曰。池有青龍。護伽藍佛法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏海藏禪院寓居比丘單況等\n謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　　　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓與\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹貞治三年甲辰正月　　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此輔行記句剽略而答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "施藥療病悲田敬田"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗曰鳥居。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚于六月有　旨入毘盧大藏海藏禪院寓居比丘單況等\n謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚讚崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓與\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹貞治三年甲辰正月　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鴨和訓賀茂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏海藏禪院寓居比丘單況等\n謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓與\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹貞治三年甲辰正月　　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "澄訓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大桂腹朽\n自然如洞窟在山中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏濟北禪庵住持比丘單況等謹\n募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓與\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹應安元年戊申十二月　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】慧下文或作惠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】慧下文或作惠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "【考】此句中文字恐可有錯\n落"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弘仁帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏濟北禪庵寓居比丘單況謹募\n眾緣刊行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其像\n今在菩提寺。俗曰穴穗寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國俗剃髮不全梵儀有妻子者在家稱沙彌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四妃意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前八面臂者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大苫邊尊。次面垂尊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祠今在寺南。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起欽明至皇極合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今之五位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起孝德至元明合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚于六月有旨入毘盧大藏平安城南禪禪寺寓居比丘單\n況謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓與\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹永和二年丙辰八月　　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起元正至廢帝合四君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起高野至承和合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起仁壽至承平合七君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起天曆至承保合十一君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起寬治盡建曆合十二君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋咸平二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鐃磐之類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏攝州報國禪寺住持比丘單況謹\n募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓興\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹永和三年丁巳八月　　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天智帝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝德帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃法道仙人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國俗以十八日為觀自在日。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大宋淳化元"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰報恩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "御三和訓近"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今曰唐院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大日本國延文庚子六月有　旨入毘盧大藏攝州報國禪寺住持比丘單\n况謹募眾緣恭為\n今上皇帝祝延　聖壽文武官僚資崇　祿位國泰民安命工鏤梓興\n大藏經印板共行一部計三十卷旹永和三年丁巳八月　　　日謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈覺之塔"}
